{
  "schema_version": "prompt-runtime.program-scenario.v1",
  "story_path": "user_stories/agent-adapters-ports.md",
  "criteria": [
    {
      "id": "AC1",
      "text": "`parseAgentAuthStatus` classifies Codex `Logged in` or `API key configured` on exit 0 as `ready`, Claude `{\"loggedIn\":false}` on exit 0 or 1 as `signed_out`, and raises `invalid-auth-probe` when `agent` is blank."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC2",
      "text": "`discoverAgents` loads launcher definitions, runs help and status probes via `process.run`, maps missing executables to `not_installed`, and raises `invalid-discovery-cwd` when `cwd` is blank."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC3",
      "text": "`askAgent` parses a strict JSON reply from `process.run`, preserves `run: true` only when `supportsRun`, `supportsApply`, `apply: true`, and a valid `fill` are present, writes scrubbed failure stderr to `log.append` when a CLI invocation fails, and raises `invalid-agent-request` for an unknown agent."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC4",
      "text": "`runAgentProcess` returns `{code, stdout, stderr}` from `process.run` and raises `executable-missing` when `executableMissing` is true."
    }
  ],
